{"text":"今天忙到没力气看任务了","intent":"original_only","group":"v2-train-additions-original_only-0"}
{"text":"晚上八点了，我只想躺着","intent":"original_only","group":"v2-train-additions-original_only-1"}
{"text":"文件还没有寄出，不要关这条","intent":"original_only","group":"v2-train-additions-original_only-2"}
{"text":"先搁一搁，原来那条继续留着","intent":"original_only","group":"v2-train-additions-original_only-3"}
{"text":"不是已验收，只是快验完了","intent":"original_only","group":"v2-train-additions-original_only-4"}
{"text":"问一下，发票是否已经寄过了","intent":"original_only","group":"v2-train-additions-original_only-5"}
{"text":"顺手留个事：找物业换门禁卡，日子先空着","intent":"capture","group":"v2-train-additions-capture-0"}
{"text":"把整理旧资料记下来，不安排闹钟","intent":"capture","group":"v2-train-additions-capture-1"}
{"text":"记一下这件小事，回头取干洗","intent":"capture","group":"v2-train-additions-capture-2"}
{"text":"留一个查燃气账单的事项，不用设时间","intent":"capture","group":"v2-train-additions-capture-3"}
{"text":"抽空修拉链，先帮我收进清单","intent":"capture","group":"v2-train-additions-capture-4"}
{"text":"给我记下给医院打电话，哪天再定","intent":"capture","group":"v2-train-additions-capture-5"}
{"text":"今晚八点给我个提醒，关一下加湿器","intent":"reminder","group":"v2-train-additions-reminder-0"}
{"text":"到六点二十分叫我拔充电线","intent":"reminder","group":"v2-train-additions-reminder-1"}
{"text":"明天早上七点半喊我倒垃圾","intent":"reminder","group":"v2-train-additions-reminder-2"}
{"text":"二十分钟后提醒我看看烤箱","intent":"reminder","group":"v2-train-additions-reminder-3"}
{"text":"后天上午十一点通知我查邮件","intent":"reminder","group":"v2-train-additions-reminder-4"}
{"text":"给我设个今晚九点半的提醒，别忘拿钥匙","intent":"reminder","group":"v2-train-additions-reminder-5"}
{"text":"我在考虑月底换个输入法","intent":"suggest","group":"v2-train-additions-suggest-0"}
{"text":"打算看看能不能周末去试车，尚未决定","intent":"suggest","group":"v2-train-additions-suggest-1"}
{"text":"我倾向找机会把房间重新布置一下","intent":"suggest","group":"v2-train-additions-suggest-2"}
{"text":"下班可能去取样品，还没定","intent":"suggest","group":"v2-train-additions-suggest-3"}
{"text":"想先看看要不要报个课程","intent":"suggest","group":"v2-train-additions-suggest-4"}
{"text":"我琢磨下月尝试一个新的备份方法","intent":"suggest","group":"v2-train-additions-suggest-5"}
{"text":"借的工牌刚才已经归还了","intent":"complete","group":"v2-train-additions-complete-0"}
{"text":"附件传好了，这一项能收尾了","intent":"complete","group":"v2-train-additions-complete-1"}
{"text":"那笔停车费已经付清","intent":"complete","group":"v2-train-additions-complete-2"}
{"text":"订票那件已办妥","intent":"complete","group":"v2-train-additions-complete-3"}
{"text":"旧设备已经交接出去了","intent":"complete","group":"v2-train-additions-complete-4"}
{"text":"文件我刚寄完，任务可以结掉","intent":"complete","group":"v2-train-additions-complete-5"}
{"text":"那条取书通知撤掉吧，不用了","intent":"cancel","group":"v2-train-additions-cancel-0"}
{"text":"出门这条提醒不要了，取消它","intent":"cancel","group":"v2-train-additions-cancel-1"}
{"text":"接人改由同事负责，撤掉我的待办","intent":"cancel","group":"v2-train-additions-cancel-2"}
{"text":"把查物流的提醒关掉，这条不留了","intent":"cancel","group":"v2-train-additions-cancel-3"}
